---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | NoTaxOTCalculator"
  description="Terms of use for NoTaxOTCalculator educational Schedule 1-A calculators. Not tax advice."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  <div class="site-wrap prose-seo py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl tracking-tight">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-mute">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      NoTaxOTCalculator provides educational estimates of possible Schedule 1-A federal income-tax deductions.
      Results are approximate, may omit rules that apply to your facts, and can become outdated when IRS guidance changes.
    </p>
    <h2>Not tax advice</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site is legal, tax, or accounting advice. Confirm with IRS Schedule 1-A instructions or a qualified
      professional before filing. We are not affiliated with the IRS or TurboTax.
    </p>
    <h2>FICA</h2>
    <p>
      Estimates concern federal income-tax deductions only. Social Security and Medicare (FICA) taxes on overtime and tips
      still apply.
    </p>
    <h2>Limitation</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, NoTaxOTCalculator and its operators are not liable for decisions made using these
      estimates. Use at your own risk.
    </p>
  </div>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
